    "Nothing happens when pressing": "No pasa nada al pulsar",
    "Check that NeuroNode is connected to the iPad (as a keyboard). If touching the screen works, the app is working.": "Compruebe que NeuroNode está conectado al iPad (como teclado). Si al tocar la pantalla funciona, la app funciona.",
